#env MBUI_WIN=1280x800
# 新建对话: a new chat beside the list (新建对话 lit); its first words sent make the chat on the station and the
# page becomes it; its agent answers there; its row comes into the list.
timeout 90000
until 新建对话
tap 新建对话
until 想让 agent 做什么？
wait 800
shot 1-new-chat
tap 做任何事
type 宽屏新对话 {T} post:宽屏新对话的回答 {T}
tap icon:arrow-up
until 宽屏新对话 {T}
gone 想让 agent 做什么？
shot 2-became-chat
timeout 120000
untiln 2 宽屏新对话的回答 {T}
shot 3-answered
